{"availability":"available","full":"amirfish1/claude-command-center","name":"claude-command-center","description":"Manage and orchestrate your Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Antigravity, Kimi, Grok, Devin, Droid sessions on your Machine. Spawn in parallel, ship in parallel. Open source.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":178,"forks":21,"created":"2026-04-13T16:16:04Z","updated":"2026-10-04T07:52:18Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://ccc.amirfish.ai","topics":["agent-orchestration","agents","ai-agents","ai-coding-agents","awesome-claude-code","claude","claude-code","codex-cli","cursor","dashboard","developer-tools","headless","kanban","llm-tools","local-first","python"],"demo":"https://ccc.amirfish.ai/demo/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:15:37.262Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T08:15:37.262Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T08:15:37.262Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T22:13:15.085Z","stars":178,"forks":21},{"at":"2026-10-04T08:15:37.262Z","stars":178,"forks":21}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["CCC puts every session on one local board and tells you which one needs you.","Start the next while Claude builds the first.","“Hey Amir, great product. I tried about 20 before finding yours. I have been really enjoying it.” — CCC user"],"features":["One board, eight engines: spawn, resume, and review Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Antigravity, Kilo Code, Kimi Code, OpenCode, and Devin sessions from one dashboard. See the engine support matrix for per-engine parity.…","Cost-aware cold-session composer: when a session is large and stale, the send button is replaced by ranked routes — continue in a new session on a cheaper tier, search history, copy session id — with the full…","FIRST FLIGHT tour: a spotlight walkthrough of the dashboard on first run, with newcomer and multi-engine paths and sample cards on empty installs. Replay any time from Settings.","Settings modal: the gear menu is a full settings modal with instant search (Cmd/Ctrl+, to open), keyboard navigation, and per-section reset — appearance, layout, sessions, fleet & network, tools, maintenance, help.","Plan-to-fleet: import a plan or mission-brief document into a WatchTower queue from the dashboard — preview the tickets wt import extracts, file them on confirm, optionally drain with a worker."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/amirfish1/claude-command-center/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e6eb14f94419574dc6a7efa874475e771a5ac42aca036f91c3719d34c01b13fc","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T22:13:15.231Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:11:11.116Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"CCC puts every session on one local board and tells you which one needs you.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/amirfish1/claude-command-center/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"optional","text":"Runs on your ChatGPT subscription; an OpenAI API key in BYOK enables an optional billed fallback.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/amirfish1/claude-command-center/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"optional","text":"Runs on your ChatGPT subscription; an OpenAI API key in BYOK enables an optional billed fallback.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/amirfish1/claude-command-center/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"CCC puts every model and engine on one board, every row enriched so you read status without clicking in: a needs-you signal, live context left, and a cost tier.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/amirfish1/claude-command-center/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"It installs into the same interpreter that runs server.py (CCC imports watchtower.queue in-process, which is why this can't be a pipx install), then runs wt start so the daemon survives reboot and login.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/amirfish1/claude-command-center/blob/main/READ